      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VALIDATION FIRST - LET THE MODEL COOK\nYellow slice = new agent or human. No slice = same chat (announce through checks, auto-fix through re-check, summary through ship).\nGreen /skill names are real invokes. Orange = model band. /grounding is not a stop: look up or write Assumption (unverified) and continue.\nGate green never authorizes Tier C. skip no-mistakes skips the checklist, not permanent deletion.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VALIDATION FIRST - LET THE MODEL COOK\nYellow slice = new agent or human. No slice = same chat (announce through checks, auto-fix through re-check, summary through ship).\nGreen /skill names are real invokes. Orange = model band. /grounding is not a stop: look up or write Assumption (unverified) and continue.\nGate green never authorizes Tier C. skip no-mistakes skips the checklist, not permanent deletion.",
